  "notes": "Ichidan verb ({一段動詞|いちだんどうし}).\n- Negative: {書|か}き{入|い}れない\n- Polite: {書|か}き{入|い}れます\n- Te-form: {書|か}き{入|い}れて\n- Past: {書|か}き{入|い}れた\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {名前|なまえ}を{書|か}き{入|い}れる: to write in one's name\n- {日付|ひづけ}を{書|か}き{入|い}れる: to fill in the date\n- {空欄|くうらん}に{書|か}き{入|い}れる: to fill in the blank\n- {手帳|てちょう}に{書|か}き{入|い}れる: to write in one's planner\n\nUSAGE:\nThe related noun {書|か}き{入|い}れ{時|どき} means \"peak business period\" — the time when shopkeepers are busiest writing entries in their account books.",
